{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/extras/steam_page_gif4-1.gif?t=1751645173\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the portals of the Mystic Woods to defeat hordes of enemies threatening the Kingdom of the Holy Slime. But don\u2019t worry\u2014you won\u2019t face these battles alone. <strong>Your cute, tiny, yet battle-ready companion will support you on your mission.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/extras/steam_page_gif2.gif?t=1751645173\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/extras/sessions.png?t=1751645173\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/extras/steam_page_gif3.gif?t=1751645173\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jump into 10-minute sessions and fight for survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/extras/build.png?t=1751645173\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/extras/steam_page_gif5.gif?t=1751645173\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose from over 40 items to create the best possible build and keep the monster hordes at bay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/extras/slimes.png?t=1751645173\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/extras/short3.gif?t=1751645173\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock and choose from 13 companions throughout the game. Each one comes with a unique ability.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/extras/coop.png?t=1751645173\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/extras/steam_page_gif7.gif?t=1751645173\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel the world solo or together. All you need is one keyboard\u2014but gamepad support is also included.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/extras/worlds.png?t=1751645173\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/extras/steam_page_gif9.gif?t=1751645173\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_parag